[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://cnpc0bell0001"]

; The NIGHT OFFICER - relieving officer for the night shift. Paces the
; bullpen, swings past the front desk to say hello, gripes about the vending
; machine, and tells you the evidence clerk always ducks out early leaving
; his card at the desk.

